# The web image is built from the repository root. Keep local credentials and
# generated development state out of every Docker build context.
.git
.gitignore
**/[.]env
**/[.]env.*
**/*.bak
.venv
.venv-*
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/[.]next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
docs/evidence
outputs
warehouse.db
